messages.content:
Extract the fields below from the passage. Use only what the passage states. Where the passage does not give a value, report it as {"type": "unknown", "reason": "..."} rather than inferring or guessing one. Answer with JSON matching the schema and nothing else.

Schema:
{
  "$defs": {
    "Unknown": {
      "description": "The value the field asks for, where the agent established that it is not available. Supply `reason` saying what was looked for and what was found instead.",
      "properties": {
        "type": {
          "const": "unknown",
          "default": "unknown",
          "title": "Type",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "reason": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "description": "What was looked for, and what was found instead.",
          "title": "Reason"
        }
      },
      "title": "Unknown",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "properties": {
    "retailer": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Unknown"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The value itself, or {\"type\": \"unknown\", \"reason\": \"...\"} where it is not available. Send the object, not the word \"unknown\".",
      "title": "Retailer"
    },
    "returns_policy": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Unknown"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The value itself, or {\"type\": \"unknown\", \"reason\": \"...\"} where it is not available. Send the object, not the word \"unknown\".",
      "title": "Returns Policy"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "retailer",
    "returns_policy"
  ],
  "title": "Finding",
  "type": "object"
}

Passage:
The Belmont trouser has a 34 inch inseam and is made of linen. Sold by Kirkwall.

response.content:
{
  "retailer": "Kirkwall",
  "returns_policy": {
    "type": "unknown",
    "reason": "The passage does not mention a returns policy."
  }
}
